  "s03": {
    "duration": 33.264,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "那偏要放在不对齐的位置呢？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 25797171
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "多数机器允许，但代价来了。",
        "offset": 26297171,
        "duration": 29127360
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "内存是按块读的：一次搬一个存储字，起点必须落在块的边界上。",
        "offset": 55424531,
        "duration": 57783021
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "一个 double 放在偏移二，就横跨了两个存储字。",
        "offset": 113207553,
        "duration": 40566039
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "取这一个数，要拆成两次访存。",
        "offset": 153773593,
        "duration": 30660379
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "再把两半拼回去，电路多一级，时间多一倍。",
        "offset": 184433972,
        "duration": 40448115
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "在更严格的架构上，比如某些 ARM，这不只是慢，直接抛异常。",
        "offset": 224882087,
        "duration": 54245285
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以对齐不是为了好看，是为了让一次访存，真的一次搬完。",
        "offset": 279127373,
        "duration": 52948116
      }
    ],
